{"text": "The last spirit was a silent phantom covered in a long black robe. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It showed him the Cratchit home, where the family quietly missed Tiny Tim. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At last, Scrooge saw a lonely grave with his own name on the stone. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I will honor Christmas in my heart and try to keep it all the year, he cried. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Scrooge woke up in his own bed, and it was Christmas morning. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He opened the window and asked a boy to buy the prize turkey. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He sent it to Bob Cratchit, but he did not say who sent it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the street, he promised a large gift to one of the gentlemen who had visited his office. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he went to Freds house for dinner, and everyone welcomed him warmly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The next day, he raised Bobs salary and promised to help his family. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He became a second father to Tiny Tim, who did not die. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And so, as Tiny Tim said, God bless us, every one.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "l", "a", "s", "t", " ", "s", "p", "i", "r", "i", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "s", "i", "l", "e", "n", "t", " ", "p", "h", "a", "n", "t", "o", "m", " ", "c", "o", "v", "e", "r", "e", "d", " ", "i", "n", " ", "a", " ", "l", "o", "n", "g", " ", "b", "l", "a", "c", "k", " ", "r", "o", "b", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "t", " ", "s", "h", "o", "w", "e", "d", " ", "h", "i", "m", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "C", "r", "a", "t", "c", "h", "i", "t", " ", "h", "o", "m", "e", ",", " ", "w", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "a", "m", "i", "l", "y", " ", "q", "u", "i", "e", "t", "l", "y", " ", "m", "i", "s", "s", "e", "d", " ", "T", "i", "n", "y", " ", "T", "i", "m", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=",